  "title": "Lady Locks",
  "description": "Lady Locks, or cream horns, are delicate pastry tubes filled with sweet vanilla cream. These dainty cookies are lovely for a bridal shower!",
  "authors": [
    "Deborah"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-09-15T19:48:45-04:00",
